(This tool performs a VLOOKUP-style merge between two files. It takes a MAIN FILE containing your primary) Tj
T* (dataset \(with potentially hundreds of records\) and an APPEND FILE with additional fields to add. The tool matches) Tj
T* (records based on a common identifier called "siteacronym" and appends new columns to all matching rows.) Tj
