(Imagine you have a file with 500 invoice records across 14 different client sites. You want to add 5 new data fields) Tj
T* (\(like contact info, billing codes, etc.\) to each record based on which site it belongs to. Instead of manually entering) Tj
T* (this information 500 times, you create a simple file with 14 rows \(one per site\) containing the 5 fields. This tool) Tj
T* (automatically adds those fields to all 500 records based on matching site identifiers.) Tj
